{"id":"gullfoss","name":"Gullfoss","qid":"Q38519","country":"Iceland","locality":"Hrunamannahreppur; Bláskógabyggð","lat":"64.327330041","lon":"-20.119399731","built":"","year":null,"year_text":"","century":"","era":"Natural formations","period":"","date_basis":"","style":"","heritage":"","type":"waterfall","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gullfoss","text":"Gullfoss (\"Golden Falls\";  [ˈkʏtl̥ˌfɔsː]) is a waterfall located in the canyon of the Hvítá river in southwest Iceland, between the municipalities of Bláskógabyggð and Hrunamannahreppur. It is one of the most popular tourist attractions in the country, and is included in \"Golden Circle\" tours of the countryside near Reykjavík.","text_source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gullfoss","text_license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","real":[],"depictions":[{"id":"civilization-vii--gullfoss","game":"civilization-vii","name":"Gullfoss","verified":false,"text":"","text_source":"","text_license":"","images":[{"id":"gh-peca8ecda156","w":1400,"h":788,"credit":{"text":"Screenshot from Civilization VII, © 2K.","source":"https://civilization.fandom.com/wiki/File:Gullfoss_in-game_(Civ7).png","via":"Fandom (civilization)","note":"Fandom upload by Jostriker on 2026-06-19"}}]}]}